@Construction.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_LOGIN_RESPONSE
@projectId = REPLACE_WITH_PROJECT_ID
@entryId = REPLACE_WITH_ACTIVITY_LOG_ENTRY_ID
@taskId = REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID

### Reference — anonymous
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reference/options
Accept: application/json

### Auth — register
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-user@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "excludeFromMarketing": false
}

### Auth — login
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@construction.local",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Auth — me
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Onboarding — update preferences
PUT {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "measurementSystem": "Metric",
  "currency": "USD",
  "timeZoneId": "America/New_York",
  "temperatureUnit": "Celsius"
}

### Onboarding — update company
PUT {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/company
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyDescription": "Builder"
}

### Onboarding — complete
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/onboarding/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startMode": "Scratch"
}

### Projects — list
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Projects — create
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Build",
  "type": "NewHome",
  "status": "New",
  "description": "Example project"
}

### Dashboard — list tasks
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard — create task (multipart; add an "attachment" file part to attach a document, max 25 MB)
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=task

--task
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Pour foundation slab
--task
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assigneeName"

Miguel Torres
--task
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assignedDate"

2026-09-15
--task
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deadline"

2026-09-22
--task--

### Dashboard — edit a task (a status change also adds an activity-log row; phaseId may be null)
PUT {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pour foundation slab",
  "assigneeName": "Miguel Torres",
  "deadline": "2026-09-29",
  "phaseId": null,
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Dashboard — activity log
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/activity-log
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Task Log — "New Log" on a task (multipart; category is one of Framing/Structural/Finishing/Electrical/Mechanical/Plumbing; optional "attachment" file part, max 25 MB)
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/activity-log
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=log

--log
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="taskId"

{{taskId}}
--log
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

Structural
--log
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assigneeName"

Miguel Torres
--log
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

Beam pockets inspected; OK to set the second-floor joists.
--log--

### Budget — record an expense (multipart; status Pending/Paid/Scheduled; omit referenceNumber to get INV-{year}-{seq}; optional "receipt" file part, max 25 MB)
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=expense

--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="vendorName"

Pioneer Wire & Cable
--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="amount"

4259.87
--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Scheduled
--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="issuedDate"

2026-10-13
--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="referenceNumber"

#1234fre
--expense
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Conduit and cable for the level 2 rough-in.
--expense--

### Dashboard — edit an activity-log description
PUT {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/activity-log/{{entryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Completed installation of recessed ceiling downlight enclosures."
}

### Purchase orders — list (search PO# / vendor / item, filter by status)
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/purchase-orders?search=wire&status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Purchase orders — KPI summary
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/purchase-orders/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Purchase orders — create
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/purchase-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorName": "Electrical Supply Co.",
  "lineItems": [
    { "description": "Electrical materials", "quantity": 5, "unitPrice": 4000 },
    { "description": "Plumbing supplies", "quantity": 3, "unitPrice": 2500 }
  ],
  "deliveryDate": "2026-11-15",
  "notes": "Level 2 rough-in."
}

### Purchase orders — mark as paid
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}/mark-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Purchase orders — delete (Pending only; Paid → 409)
DELETE {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/purchase-orders/{{purchaseOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change orders — list (search CO# / description / reason, filter by status Pending/Approved/Rejected)
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/change-orders?search=hvac&status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change orders — KPI summary (total = Pending + Approved)
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/change-orders/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change orders — create
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/change-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Upgrade to LED lighting",
  "amount": 1234.99,
  "requestedDate": "2026-10-22",
  "reason": "Owner request"
}

### Change orders — approve (Pending only; otherwise 409)
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/change-orders/{{changeOrderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change orders — reject (Pending only; otherwise 409)
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/change-orders/{{changeOrderId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoices — list (search INV# / vendor, filter by status Pending/Paid/Scheduled)
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/invoices?search=hvac&status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoices — KPI summary (contract value = budget + approved change orders)
GET {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/invoices/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoices — mark as paid
POST {{Construction.Api_HostAddress}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/budget/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/mark-paid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
